2. EDITION & E2EE

The Pro Edition includes all features of the Community Edition plus
End-to-End Encryption (E2EE) for chat messages and file transfers.
E2EE provides cryptographic protection such that only meeting
participants can read messages and files — the server operator
cannot access the content.

E2EE uses the following cryptographic stack:

- Key Exchange: ECDH P-256
- Key Derivation: HKDF-SHA-256
- Symmetric Encryption: AES-256-GCM

